  },
  "changes": [
    {
      "area": "Release build",
      "details": "design-studio release uses Thin LTO and one codegen unit; no global target-cpu=native, unsafe or relaxed floating-point flags."
    },
    {
      "area": "WASM build",
      "details": "Staged binding generation, optional name-section stripping (keep with --keep-names), isolated --simd/--wasm-opt outputs, existing Rust flags preserved. Public live artifacts were not replaced by these tests."
    },
    {
      "area": "Color output",
      "details": "Prepared FromWorkingTransform/OutputTransform compute fixed inverse/adaptation matrices once per output buffer. Matrix multiply order and all transfer curves remain unchanged; no approximate sRGB LUT."
    },
    {
      "area": "Blend/rows",
      "details": "Parse blend mode once per paint/composite; typed mode preserves unknown-string fallback and exact arithmetic. Surface composite, RGBA8 composite and interpolation use checked contiguous row slices."
    },
    {
      "area": "Text paths",
      "details": "node_path_shared returns Arc<Path>. LocalPaths keeps ordinary geometry owned and shares only cached text outlines, avoiding two additional Arc allocations for ordinary shapes. Read-only geometry, picking and SVG callers use the shared path; owned public node_path compatibility remains. LRU keys share Arc<[u8]> on hits; the full exact serialized key is retained."
    },
    {
      "area": "Tile options",
      "details": "Replace Debug formatting with InstructionOptions field equality; no hashing/collision assumption or per-hit string allocation."
    },
    {
      "area": "Scanline allocation",
      "details": "Analytic eight-sample visit_spans uses contiguous linked edge storage and head/tail row indices, preserving insertion order and exact intersection arithmetic. It removes per-nonempty-row Vec allocations; row-head storage is 16 rather than 24 bytes on 64-bit hosts, with one next-index per edge. This is not a claim of universally lower peak memory; actual timing/memory benchmarks were not run."
    },
    {
      "area": "Server font resources",
      "details": "Startup-loaded, validated Fonts resources are shared by Arc. Each request gets independent Engine document state via with_fonts; default font bytes are no longer copied, validated and hashed per request. Render slots remain 2; no new PNG parallel path or whole Engine pool."
    },
    {
      "area": "Existing server tests",
      "details": "Two stale assertions rejected schema 9 although runtime already admits 1..=11. Tests now cover accepted 6..=11 and rejected 12. Runtime schema admission was not expanded."
    }
  ],
